{"schema":"mao-cross-channel-public-site-data/1","script":"0299","rows":[{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0299:00000106:text","row":39643,"ordinal":1,"kind":"text","jp":"適当なところで、休憩することにした。","en":"I decided this was as good a place as any to take a break.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904350","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0009:00001","en":"At a suitable time, I decided to take a break.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0299:00000142:text","row":39644,"ordinal":2,"kind":"text","jp":"食堂でサンドイッチを食べる。","en":"I ate a sandwich in the cafeteria.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904351","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0009:00002","en":"Eating sandwiches in the cafeteria,","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0299:00000176:text","row":39645,"ordinal":3,"kind":"text","jp":"食べながら考える。","en":"I thought as I ate.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904352","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0009:00003","en":"and while eating, thinking.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0299:00000223:text","row":39646,"ordinal":4,"kind":"text","jp":"一週間の世界。","en":"A world one week long.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904353","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0009:00004","en":"A world of one week.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0299:00000242:text","row":39647,"ordinal":5,"kind":"text","jp":"不思議と抵抗がない。","en":"Strangely, the idea didn't bother me.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904354","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0009:00005","en":"Inexplicably, no repulsion.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0299:00000267:text","row":39648,"ordinal":6,"kind":"text","jp":"俺にとっては、ずっと先まで続いている世界より、生きやすいと思うからだ。","en":"I thought it would be easier for me to live in than a world stretching endlessly into the future.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904355","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0009:00006","en":"Because as far as I'm concerned, I think it a far\neasier thing to live in than a world that\ncontinues ahead forever.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0299:000002be:text","row":39649,"ordinal":7,"kind":"text","jp":"繰り返される日々。","en":"The same days, over and over.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904356","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0009:00007","en":"Days that repeat over and over again...","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0299:000002e1:text","row":39650,"ordinal":8,"kind":"text","jp":"ふと考えた。","en":"A thought occurred to me.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904357","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0009:00008","en":"Accidentally, a thought,","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["word_choice","mistranslation"],"assessment":"The Japanese says a thought suddenly or idly occurs to him. 'Accidentally' implies an unintended action and the English fragment lacks a verb.","remedy":"A thought suddenly occurred to me.","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":24,"start":0,"text":"Accidentally, a thought,"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0299:000002fe:text","row":39651,"ordinal":9,"kind":"text","jp":"考えてしまった。","en":"And I let myself entertain it.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904358","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0009:00009","en":"a damnable thought.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0299:00000337:text","row":39652,"ordinal":10,"kind":"text","jp":"幾度となく紡がれる一週間。その中で、全員が和解する可能性はないのか？","en":"Across all the countless repetitions of that one week, could there be one where everyone made peace?","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904359","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0009:00010","en":"The yarn of this one week has been spun so many\ntimes. Within that, is there no possibility that\nall of us could be reconciled?","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0299:0000038c:text","row":39653,"ordinal":11,"kind":"text","jp":"放送部八人の結束はバラバラだ。","en":"The eight members of the Broadcasting Club had splintered apart.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904360","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0009:00011","en":"The unity of the eight of the Broadcast Club\nis all broken up.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0299:000003bb:text","row":39654,"ordinal":12,"kind":"text","jp":"誰か一人と和解しようと思っても、簡単にはいかない。","en":"Even reconciling with one person wouldn’t be easy.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904361","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0009:00012","en":"But even if I intend to be reconciled with\na single person, it isn't going to be simple.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0299:000003fe:text","row":39655,"ordinal":13,"kind":"text","jp":"日記から読み取れたことでもある。","en":"The diaries had told me that much.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904362","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0009:00013","en":"That is also something I have taken from\nreading the diaries.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0299:0000042f:text","row":39656,"ordinal":14,"kind":"text","jp":"もしあるなら。","en":"But if such a week existed...","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904363","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0009:00014","en":"Suppose there is a way.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0299:0000044e:text","row":39657,"ordinal":15,"kind":"text","jp":"……見てみたい。","en":"...I wanted to see it.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904364","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0009:00015","en":"...I want to see it.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0299:000004e8:text","row":39658,"ordinal":16,"kind":"text","jp":"「はい、お茶を召し上がれ」","en":"“Here. Have some tea.”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904365","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0009:00016","en":"Youko: \"Here, tea is served.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0299:00000522:text","row":39659,"ordinal":17,"kind":"text","jp":"「……んー」","en":"“...Mmm.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904366","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0009:00017","en":"Taichi: ...hmmm.\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["typography","presentation"],"assessment":"The dialogue has a closing quotation mark but no opening quotation mark.","remedy":"Taichi: \"...hmmm.\"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":17,"start":0,"text":"Taichi: ...hmmm.\""}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0299:0000054e:text","row":39660,"ordinal":18,"kind":"text","jp":"「んっんっんっ……ぷはーっ！　冷たくてうまいな、おかーり」","en":"“Glug, glug, glug... Ahhh! Nice and cold. 'Nother!”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904367","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0009:00018","en":"Taichi: \"gLpgLpgLp... pwaaah! Cold'n'tasty, seconds pleeease!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0299:000005a0:text","row":39661,"ordinal":19,"kind":"text","jp":"プラスチックのコップを差し出す。","en":"I held out my plastic cup.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904368","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0009:00019","en":"I hold out a plastic tumbler.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0299:000005d8:text","row":39662,"ordinal":20,"kind":"text","jp":"彼女はコップを受け取ると無言で水筒の中身を注い支倉曜子がそこにいた。","en":"She took the cup and silently refilled it from the thermos. Youko Hasekura was there.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904369","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0009:00020","en":"She who accepts the cup and wordlessly pours the contents of a canteen into it is Hasekura Youko, who was standing there.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0299:0000063c:text","row":39663,"ordinal":21,"kind":"text","jp":"「……気配を消すな」","en":"“...Quit sneaking up on me.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904370","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0009:00021","en":"Taichi: \"...don'tcha erase your presence.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0299:000006ee:text","row":39664,"ordinal":22,"kind":"text","jp":"「どうして？」","en":"“Why not?”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904371","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0009:00022","en":"Youko: \"Why?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0299:0000071c:text","row":39665,"ordinal":23,"kind":"text","jp":"「いきなりそばに来られると驚くから」","en":"“Because it startles me when you suddenly appear beside me.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904372","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0009:00023","en":"Taichi: \"Because you just suddenly coming to people's side is startling.\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["grammar","addition"],"assessment":"Taichi says he is startled when she suddenly appears beside him. The English uses an ungrammatical gerund subject and generalizes the reaction to people at large.","remedy":"it startles me when you suddenly appear beside me","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":71,"start":17,"text":"you just suddenly coming to people's side is startling"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0299:000007de:text","row":39666,"ordinal":24,"kind":"text","jp":"「別に消してるわけじゃない。自然にそうなるのよ」","en":"“I'm not sneaking. It just happens naturally.”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904373","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0009:00024","en":"Youko: \"There's no particular erasing on my side. It's naturally like that.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0299:0000082e:text","row":39667,"ordinal":25,"kind":"text","jp":"「……唐突に声をかけられたら、誰だって驚くんだ」","en":"“...Anyone would jump if you spoke to them out of nowhere.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904374","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0009:00025","en":"Taichi: \"...anyone would be startled at being addressed abruptly.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0299:000008fc:text","row":39668,"ordinal":26,"kind":"text","jp":"「油断？」","en":"“You let your guard down?”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904375","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0009:00026","en":"Youko: \"Off guard?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0299:00000926:text","row":39669,"ordinal":27,"kind":"text","jp":"「いや、油断したいから」","en":"“No. I want to be able to let my guard down.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904376","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0009:00027","en":"Taichi: \"Yeah, because I wanna be off guard.\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["logical_relation","mistranslation"],"assessment":"Taichi rejects the label and explains that he wants to be able to let his guard down. The English begins with agreement, reversing the response.","remedy":"No. I want to be able to let my guard down.","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":44,"start":9,"text":"Yeah, because I wanna be off guard."}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0299:0000097b:text","row":39670,"ordinal":28,"kind":"text","jp":"「怠慢？」","en":"“Laziness?”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904377","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0009:00028","en":"Youko: \"Negligent?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0299:000009a5:text","row":39671,"ordinal":29,"kind":"text","jp":"「のんびり生きたいって意味だよ」","en":"“I mean I want to take life easy.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904378","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0009:00029","en":"Taichi: \"It just means I wanna live more leisurely!\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0299:00000a63:text","row":39672,"ordinal":30,"kind":"text","jp":"「……もったいない」","en":"“...What a waste.”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904379","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0009:00030","en":"Youko: \"...blasphemy.\"","verdict":"questionable","categories":["register_voice","overinterpretation"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0299:00000a97:text","row":39673,"ordinal":31,"kind":"text","jp":"「疲れるよ。いつも刺々しく気を張りつめてさ」","en":"“It's exhausting, always being so prickly and wound tight.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904380","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0009:00031","en":"Taichi: \"I'm tired. Of always being under this sharp mental strain.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0299:00000b61:text","row":39674,"ordinal":32,"kind":"text","jp":"「そういうのを日常化すればいいと思う」","en":"“I think you should make that your normal state.”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904381","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0009:00032","en":"Youko: \"Making that the ordinary would be best, I think.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["typography","presentation"],"assessment":"The dialogue line lacks its closing quotation mark.","remedy":"Youko: \"Making that ordinary would be best, I think.\"","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":56,"start":0,"text":"Youko: \"Making that the ordinary would be best, I think."}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0299:00000c25:text","row":39675,"ordinal":33,"kind":"text","jp":"「太一のは、ただのさぼり癖」","en":"“Yours is just plain laziness, Taichi.”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904382","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0009:00033","en":"Youko: \"Taichi simply has the bad habit of playing truant.\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["word_choice","register_voice"],"assessment":"Youko accuses him of a general habit of slacking off. 'Playing truant' specifically means unauthorized absence from school.","remedy":"a simple habit of slacking off","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":57,"start":26,"text":"the bad habit of playing truant"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0299:00000c61:text","row":39676,"ordinal":34,"kind":"text","jp":"「絶交しますよ」","en":"“We're not friends anymore.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904383","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0009:00034","en":"Taichi: \"We will be through, permanently.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0299:00000d0f:text","row":39677,"ordinal":35,"kind":"text","jp":"「……撤回するわ」","en":"“...I take it back.”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904384","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0009:00035","en":"Youko: \"...I withdraw that, yes.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0299:00000d39:text","row":39678,"ordinal":36,"kind":"text","jp":"口論が発生しない。","en":"There was no argument.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904385","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0009:00036","en":"No quarrel break outs,","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["grammar","typography"],"assessment":"The singular subject requires 'breaks out'; 'breakout' is not a two-word finite verb in this form.","remedy":"No quarrel breaks out","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":21,"start":0,"text":"No quarrel break outs"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0299:00000d63:text","row":39679,"ordinal":37,"kind":"text","jp":"駆け引きが成立しない。","en":"No push and pull.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904386","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0009:00037","en":"no bargaining comes to be,","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0299:00000d91:text","row":39680,"ordinal":38,"kind":"text","jp":"トラブルが起こらない。","en":"No trouble.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904387","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0009:00038","en":"no trouble occurs.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0299:00000dbf:text","row":39681,"ordinal":39,"kind":"text","jp":"受けるばかりで、何も与えられない。","en":"I could only receive. I had nothing to give.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904388","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0009:00039","en":"Only receiving, never giving.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0299:00000df9:text","row":39682,"ordinal":40,"kind":"text","jp":"心の交流がない。","en":"Nothing passed between our hearts.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904389","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0009:00040","en":"There is no reciprocal interchange of the heart.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0299:00000e29:text","row":39683,"ordinal":41,"kind":"text","jp":"「自分の一部を、愛でるような感覚なんだよね」","en":"“It feels like I'm cherishing part of myself.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904390","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0009:00041","en":"Taichi: \"That feels like you're just loving a part of yourself, you know.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0299:00000ef3:text","row":39684,"ordinal":42,"kind":"text","jp":"「……違う」","en":"“...No.”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904391","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0009:00042","en":"Youko: \"...wrong.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0299:00000f17:text","row":39685,"ordinal":43,"kind":"text","jp":"理解ははやい。","en":"She understood quickly.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904392","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0009:00043","en":"She's quick to understand,","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0299:00000f3d:text","row":39686,"ordinal":44,"kind":"text","jp":"けど、俺を理解してはくれない。","en":"She just didn't understand me.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904393","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0009:00044","en":"yet she lets me have no understanding of myself.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["wrong_subject","mistranslation"],"assessment":"The Japanese says that despite understanding quickly, she will not understand him. The English instead says she prevents him from understanding himself.","remedy":"but she won't understand me","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":47,"start":4,"text":"she lets me have no understanding of myself"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0299:00000ff9:text","row":39687,"ordinal":45,"kind":"text","jp":"「私は太一を愛でてるだけ」","en":"“I'm only cherishing you, Taichi.”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904394","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0009:00045","en":"Youko: \"I just love you, Taichi.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0299:00001033:text","row":39688,"ordinal":46,"kind":"text","jp":"「……ま、そういうことにしとくよ」","en":"“...Sure. Let's leave it at that.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904395","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0009:00046","en":"Taichi: \"...well, that's what you decided to do.\"","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["wrong_subject","logical_relation"],"assessment":"Taichi says he will leave it at that or accept her formulation for convenience. The English attributes a prior decision to Youko.","remedy":"I'll leave it at that.","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":47,"start":18,"text":"that's what you decided to do"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0299:0000106d:text","row":39689,"ordinal":47,"kind":"text","jp":"面倒になった。","en":"I was done with this.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904396","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0009:00047","en":"This became annoying.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0299:00001093:text","row":39690,"ordinal":48,"kind":"text","jp":"どうせ何言ってもこたえないし。","en":"Nothing I said could get to her anyway.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904397","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0009:00048","en":"Whatever I say she doesn't answer.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["mistranslation","idiom_calque"],"assessment":"The Japanese says nothing he says gets through to or affects her. It does not say she fails to give verbal replies.","remedy":"nothing I say gets through to her","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":33,"start":15,"text":"she doesn't answer"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0299:000010c9:text","row":39691,"ordinal":49,"kind":"text","jp":"俺が彼女に対して、効果的な一撃を加えるとしたら。","en":"If I had one blow that could actually hurt her...","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904398","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0009:00049","en":"What if I were to inflict an effective attack on her?","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0299:00001111:text","row":39692,"ordinal":50,"kind":"text","jp":"……一つ。","en":"...There was one.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904399","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0009:00050","en":"...a single solitary one?","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0299:00001133:text","row":39693,"ordinal":51,"kind":"text","jp":"それは小さな刃。","en":"A tiny blade.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904400","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0009:00051","en":"It would be a tiny blade,","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0299:0000115b:text","row":39694,"ordinal":52,"kind":"text","jp":"だが確実に、崩せる。","en":"But it could crack her defenses. Without fail.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904401","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0009:00052","en":"but it would certainly be her destruction.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["overinterpretation","mistranslation"],"assessment":"The tiny blade could reliably break her composure or defenses. The English escalates this to her total destruction.","remedy":"it could definitely break her down","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":41,"start":4,"text":"it would certainly be her destruction"}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0299:00001187:text","row":39695,"ordinal":53,"kind":"text","jp":"曜子ちゃんもその存在を知っている。","en":"Youko knew it existed.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904402","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0009:00053","en":"Youko-chan also knows of its existence.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0299:000011c1:text","row":39696,"ordinal":54,"kind":"text","jp":"だから警戒してる。","en":"That was why she stayed on guard.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904403","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0009:00054","en":"That is why she is wary.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0299:000011eb:text","row":39697,"ordinal":55,"kind":"text","jp":"牽制しあいつつ、俺たちは生きている。","en":"We lived on, each keeping the other in check.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904404","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0009:00055","en":"We live by playing a game that keeps us in reciprocal check.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0299:0000122f:text","row":39698,"ordinal":56,"kind":"text","jp":"「まったくなぁ」","en":"“Honestly...”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904405","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0009:00056","en":"Taichi: \"Dammit all.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0299:00001257:text","row":39699,"ordinal":57,"kind":"text","jp":"パクつく。","en":"I took another bite.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904406","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0009:00057","en":"I chug down.","verdict":"confirmed_error","categories":["word_choice","mistranslation"],"assessment":"The narrator munches or bites into the sandwiches. 'Chug' describes quickly drinking liquid.","remedy":"I munch away.","highlights":[{"color":"red","end":12,"start":0,"text":"I chug down."}]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0299:00001297:text","row":39700,"ordinal":58,"kind":"text","jp":"くぅ","en":"Mmph.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904407","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0009:00058","en":"Gulp.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0299:000012bb:text","row":39701,"ordinal":59,"kind":"text","jp":"「…………」","en":"“............”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904408","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0009:00059","en":"Youko: \"......\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0299:000012e7:text","row":39702,"ordinal":60,"kind":"text","jp":"「……座ったら？」","en":"“...Why don’t you sit down?”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904409","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0009:00060","en":"Taichi: \"...wanna sit?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0299:00001397:text","row":39703,"ordinal":61,"kind":"text","jp":"「……いいの？」","en":"“...Can I?”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904410","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0009:00061","en":"Youko: \"...may I?\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0299:000013c7:text","row":39704,"ordinal":62,"kind":"text","jp":"「ご自由に」","en":"“Suit yourself.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904411","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0009:00062","en":"Taichi: \"Feel free to.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0299:000013eb:text","row":39705,"ordinal":63,"kind":"text","jp":"ぴったりと身を寄せてきた。","en":"She pressed close against me.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904412","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0009:00063","en":"She snugly sits next to me.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0299:0000141d:text","row":39706,"ordinal":64,"kind":"text","jp":"二人分あるサンドイッチ、半分放る。","en":"There were enough sandwiches for two. I tossed her half.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904413","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0009:00064","en":"I toss over half of the double portion of sandwiches.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0299:000014dd:text","row":39707,"ordinal":65,"kind":"text","jp":"「ありがとう」","en":"“Thank you.”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904414","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0009:00065","en":"Youko: \"Thank you.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0299:0000150b:text","row":39708,"ordinal":66,"kind":"text","jp":"「自分で作ったものでしょ」","en":"“You made them.”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904415","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0009:00066","en":"Taichi: \"You just did these yourself anyway.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0299:00001562:text","row":39709,"ordinal":67,"kind":"text","jp":"「ええ。ありがとう」","en":"“Yes. Thank you.”","speakerJa":"曜子","speakerEn":"Yoko","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904416","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0009:00067","en":"Youko: \"Yes. Thank you.\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0299:00001596:text","row":39710,"ordinal":68,"kind":"text","jp":"「……」","en":"“...”","speakerJa":"太一","speakerEn":"Taichi","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904417","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0009:00068","en":"Taichi: \"...\"","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0299:000015b6:text","row":39711,"ordinal":69,"kind":"text","jp":"こんな交流。いくら重ねたって。","en":"This little exchange. No matter how many times we repeated it...","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904424","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0009:00106","en":"Interchanges like this... however many we may repeat,","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0299:000015ec:text","row":39712,"ordinal":70,"kind":"text","jp":"ただ形をなぞっているだけだ。","en":"We were only going through the motions.","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904425","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0009:00107","en":"it is simply the mere tracing of the outline.","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0299:00001620:text","row":39713,"ordinal":71,"kind":"text","jp":"それは……俺もか。","en":"Was I doing the same?","speakerJa":"","speakerEn":"","ghs":[{"id":"ghs-tl:finding:904426","unitId":"ghs-tl:ccd0009:00108","en":"And is that... what I do as well?","verdict":"acceptable","categories":["word_choice"]}]},{"ref":"ccfc:sn:0299:00001652:text","row":39714,"ordinal":72,"kind":"text","jp":"「まあ、なんとかなるよな……」","en":"“Well, it’ll work 